{"title":"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Sum_of_equations)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Sum of equations)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Clever_Substitution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Clever Substitution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sequence\" title=\"Sequence\">sequence</a> of numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/6/3c61db98a692c031b51b5a22057c9a3125160e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1},x_{2},x_{3},\\ldots,x_{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"139\" height=\"11\" /> has the property that, for every <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36af3a317653fc5ff424093b4df40c2b4d5a6f5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"31\" height=\"16\" /> inclusive, the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/6/9d620afedf2590a311e973edf32e72a2b9e14995.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> less than the sum of the other <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> numbers. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7ecda81ec0463bca749116532878e620b3620e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{50} = m/n,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bf1afcb274a3bb84338109fffec8a1f1c02008.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the sum of all of the terms in the sequence be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/833117207ad5712c11418dd7a78028b8261b628c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"9\" height=\"13\" />. Then for each integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/763a6707c40686aa0c20e351a33275d742237d17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k = \\mathbb{S}-x_k-k \\Longrightarrow \\mathbb{S} - 2x_k = k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"258\" height=\"15\" />. Summing this up for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/2/a12d03483f38773408b29d03b5d3bd161402cf2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, \\ldots, 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/a/25a3eeef738b8674590fde236a2da3146a77c504.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}100\\mathbb{S}-2(x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{100}) &amp;= 1 + 2 + \\cdots + 100\\\\ 100\\mathbb{S} - 2\\mathbb{S} &amp;= \\frac{100 \\cdot 101}{2} = 5050\\\\ \\mathbb{S}&amp;=\\frac{2525}{49}\\end{align*}\" width=\"392\" height=\"106\" />\n</p><p>Now, substituting for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/f/bff1c5a51103f7ca4acb87fecd9dbc8995b033a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a206e29e67dd320029a8df0e2d3c49856692eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x_{50}=\\frac{2525}{49}-50=\\frac{75}{49} \\Longrightarrow x_{50}=\\frac{75}{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"293\" height=\"38\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6eb108061e0351fa88284859e68349749e4a9f86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75+98=\\boxed{173}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d3dead9cb8d5f6327c737e014850be7a29d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/1/191ef26bc72336cc70cc3ebe81e035852ced438a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the sum of the rest 98 terms. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/4/5646c66f342b50cd98ab1e2b466584312258eb7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k+k=S+x_{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/75931ef346f9dd635fb25b327678266aafdbd2ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{k+1}+(k+1)=S+x_k.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" /> Eliminating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faecd57b51f0c17dc6c2f6ec98ac17eccac0ef5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{k+1}-x_k=-\\dfrac{1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"131\" height=\"37\" /> So the sequence is arithmetic with common difference <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/3/2c3d8acd3de32f355e4bd49d6edabafaec41d124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\dfrac{1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"30\" height=\"37\" /> \n</p><p>In terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91dd57186c6d837ed0eef63615008f844fbfc72f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{50},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"11\" /> the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/3/4c3fe48283fde9d501af6410afb73a9021f65727.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{50}+\\dfrac{49}{2}, x_{50}+\\dfrac{48}{2},\\cdots,x_{50}+\\dfrac{1}{2}, x_{50}, x_{50}-\\dfrac{1}{2}, \\cdots, x_{50}-\\dfrac{49}{2}, x_{50}-\\dfrac{50}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"542\" height=\"37\" /> Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82a216ad823ff1b60ac2c15f90c00bd4ca91bbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{50}+50=99x_{50}-\\dfrac{50}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"174\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Solving, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/7/5271482a37533442e24f330867753f3677a5bde4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{50}=\\dfrac{75}{98}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" /> The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/9/d89ea158348653b7765cb4f4afd68e907cbf2f79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75+98=\\boxed{173}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"128\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>- JZ\n</p><p>- edited by erinb28lms\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Sum_of_equations.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Sum_of_equations)\">Solution 3 (Sum of equations)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Sum of equations)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like Solution 1, let the sum of all of the terms in this sequence be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/833117207ad5712c11418dd7a78028b8261b628c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"9\" height=\"13\" />. By definition:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54cf83bc2873360267b5b55f5e943d411a9e39d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_1 + 1 = x_2+x_3+x_4+...+x_{100}\\]\" width=\"260\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/d/24da44cd801dd3c0b2e0deafeb89cd654a9c5871.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_2 + 2 = x_1+x_3+x_4+...+x_{100}\\]\" width=\"260\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/f/e7fa14ea15a39c956838b07a2043325d0e513e6b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_3 + 3 = x_1+x_2+x_4+...+x_{100}\\]\" width=\"260\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a77a80061f2acc5bff28985d471dadc862f24425.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[...\\]\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b19382350d975ec3f389be233f2d95f176fb2109.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_{99} + 99 = x_1+x_2+x_3+...+x_{98}+x_{100}\\]\" width=\"322\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fdeec1f35642e14204628d2c7aec10669c90cf32.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_{100} + 100 = x_1+x_2+x_3+...+x_{98}+x_{99}\\]\" width=\"331\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Adding up all of these equations yields:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff5d50de89789deb9388a46e4b4c3ca3c435edc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\mathbb{S} + TR(100) = 99\\mathbb{S}\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Here <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/7/677b738133e316c877eed790c861a4b76cfb5ed0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$TR(100)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" /> represents the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />th triangular number, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebb15eab7e1e2cc678fddb5e858a091b0aa159f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5050$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/833117207ad5712c11418dd7a78028b8261b628c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"9\" height=\"13\" /> yields:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db034d204fb90bd2a33a4c5e002055ec2c3e708f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\mathbb{S} = \\frac{2525}{49}\\]\" width=\"72\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/833117207ad5712c11418dd7a78028b8261b628c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"9\" height=\"13\" /> can also be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/f/9efcb6fe311bd43604f41cc70df5871d3510d705.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{50} + (x_{50} + 50)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"20\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/f/bff1c5a51103f7ca4acb87fecd9dbc8995b033a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cdd2e37bb800a71b6e7c3b00bba9f8e8658cb3f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x_{50} = \\frac{2525-2450}{49}\\]\" width=\"154\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/0/fc06176658fb1bdd40e18cbce472e06417c34858.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x_{50} = \\frac{75}{49}\\]\" width=\"77\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/f/4df3924d2cb6db1d4b8f3b0d9fdd217607ff4d41.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_{50} = \\frac{75}{98}\\]\" width=\"68\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The requested sum is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8057e21def31a422590e0e86bfd540b77adf03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75+98 = \\boxed{173}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"123\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~mathwizard123123\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Clever_Substitution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Clever_Substitution)\">Solution 4 (Clever Substitution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Clever Substitution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Due to the problem's unique setup, we can actually represent every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d3dead9cb8d5f6327c737e014850be7a29d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> in terms of its sum, call it <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. For any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d3dead9cb8d5f6327c737e014850be7a29d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db165d3a83bd77774b531029e70da2dbbc94841.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_k = \\frac{S}{2} - \\frac{k}{2}\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"37\" />\nWe can show that this works because the sum of the other <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms is now equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/7/0f7c8d19f6e62cc61c7ae045942acbfd2b725935.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S}{2} + \\frac{k}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"54\" height=\"39\" />, and the difference is indeed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. The motivation to find that we need an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/6/7f6787208a24344f0b7f124daffd2ed65d16101a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"18\" height=\"39\" /> term lies in that the difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d3dead9cb8d5f6327c737e014850be7a29d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> other terms is an integer, and not an expression in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, and allowing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5d3dead9cb8d5f6327c737e014850be7a29d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> to be in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/6/7f6787208a24344f0b7f124daffd2ed65d16101a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"18\" height=\"39\" /> is the only way to achieve this.\n</p><p>Now, finding the numerical value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> solves the problem. Summing all terms from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/ccada11db7b2b90693e2fac4f887a57fce6f96bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/8/688eabba793f44a034303d6ddfdb70afdbab66be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, we find\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b30e9750ae83c0a0aca2da047ad0ac1ea99885b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S = \\sum_{k=1}^{100} x_k = 100\\frac{S}{2} - \\sum_{k=1}^{100} \\frac{k}{2} = 50S - \\frac{100\\cdot\\frac{1 + 100}{2}}{2} = 50S - 2525\\]\" width=\"490\" height=\"51\" />\n</p><p>We obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/8/2e88c88e734211e274b2c7670a7a091ed974d9d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\frac{2525}{49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"38\" />, and we now only need to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/f/bff1c5a51103f7ca4acb87fecd9dbc8995b033a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" />, which is represented as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/f/54f3cce42f9afedb87630196ba59555ec7db1f64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S}{2} - \\frac{50}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"62\" height=\"39\" />. Substituting, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/e/3cecf8940cb7f9f3a0ffcf606b80460739393d5c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_{50} = \\frac{2525}{49\\cdot2} - 25 = \\frac{25\\cdot101 - 25\\cdot98}{98} = \\frac{75}{98}\\]\" width=\"336\" height=\"38\" />\nOur desired answer is thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/f/dcf4ceb8f5e6a97f310cf65f69f425dadcc9c700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75 + 98 = \\boxed{173}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"123\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~faliure167\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution\">Video solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TdvxgrSZTQw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TdvxgrSZTQw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I\" title=\"2000 AIME I\">2000 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2000\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017155819\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 464/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1788/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 110/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 14061/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.369      1 -total\n 58.61%    9.007      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.74%    5.954      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in par